From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bron Gondwana <brong@fastmailteam.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 10:37:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] DKIM2 draft -08: hash Auto-Submitted, strict-lowercase
 tags, h= groups

Draft -08 section 4 hashes Auto-Submitted and VBR-Info. Tag-names and
Recipe JSON keys are case-sensitive and lowercase (section 8, 5): an
uppercase tag is an unknown tag and an uppercase key invalid JSON. h= is
"|" groups of "," lists (section 9.3): verify_mi_raw passes when every
hash-set of some group is a matching sha256 set. DKIM2_DRAFT spec-08,
DKIM2_DATE 2026-10-28, section pointers to -08.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
